<!--
    Kuna (IDA 9.5 gooMBA design, MBA without SMT): P3 simplification
    quiescence, option mba (default off). The groups and polynomial half.

      0x1000 mba4 (hand-assembled, subterms recomputed as an obfuscator emits
             them): (x & y) + (z & w) - (x & y & z & w)  ==  (x & y) | (z & w)
             one boolean function of four leaves (bi-decomposed)
      0x1040 mba6 (gcc -O2): (a ^ b) + 2*(a & b) + (c & ~d) + d + (e | f) - (e & f)
             ==  a + b + (c | d) + (e ^ f): six leaves in three groups
      0x1080 mbapoly (gcc -O2): (x & y) * (x | y) + (x & ~y) * (~x & y)  ==  x * y
             a polynomial MBA, normalized over the conjunction basis

    Asserts #1-#3 are the off pass: each prints as written.
    Asserts #4-#6 are the on pass: each folds.
-->
<bytechunk space="ram" offset="0x1000" readonly="true">89f821f04189d04121c84401c04189f94121f14121d14121c94429c8c3</bytechunk>
<bytechunk space="ram" offset="0x1040" readonly="true">4589c289c84509c8f7d14521ca21d189fa21f74429d031f24401c001c801d08d0478c3</bytechunk>
<bytechunk space="ram" offset="0x1080" readonly="true">89f089faf7d0f7d221f821f20fafc289fa09f721f20fafd701d0c3</bytechunk>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x1000" name="mba4"/>
